4
00:00:13,917 --> 00:00:18,167
I’m right here. I’d love to hear your dream.

5
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,583
I have a dream!

6
00:00:23,792 --> 00:00:25,167
Do you have a dream?

7
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:26,958
Yes, I do.

8
00:00:27,292 --> 00:00:28,833
Yoonsu, your turn.

9
00:00:29,208 --> 00:00:30,500
Yes, I do.

10
00:00:37,792 --> 00:00:39,583
