18
00:01:06,417 --> 00:01:07,875
The chef does.

19
00:01:08,208 --> 00:01:09,750
Yoonsu, your turn.

20
00:01:10,125 --> 00:01:11,583
The chef does.

21
00:01:17,792 --> 00:01:19,583
