22
00:01:20,083 --> 00:01:21,250
I can cook.

23
00:01:21,583 --> 00:01:23,125
Yoonsu, your turn.

24
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:24,667
I can cook.

25
00:01:31,792 --> 00:01:35,208
Here’s a stethoscope. Listen to your heartbeat.

26
00:01:36,292 --> 00:01:38,083
A doctor uses that!

27
00:01:41,792 --> 00:01:44,292
Who helps sick people?

28
00:01:44,792 --> 00:01:46,208
A doctor does.

29
00:01:46,542 --> 00:01:48,083
Yoonsu, your turn.

30
00:01:48,458 --> 00:01:49,875
A doctor does.

31
00:01:55,792 --> 00:01:58,375
Pretend you’re a doctor. What do you do?

32
00:01:58,875 --> 00:02:00,292
I help people.

33
00:02:00,625 --> 00:02:02,167
Yoonsu, your turn.

34
00:02:02,542 --> 00:02:03,958
I help people.

35
