37
00:02:20,792 --> 00:02:22,292
What do you like to do?

38
00:02:22,792 --> 00:02:24,292
I like painting.

39
00:02:24,625 --> 00:02:26,167
Yoonsu, your turn.

40
00:02:26,542 --> 00:02:28,042
I like painting.

41
00:02:34,792 --> 00:02:36,125
What can you paint?

42
00:02:36,625 --> 00:02:38,083
I paint flowers.

43
00:02:38,417 --> 00:02:39,958
Yoonsu, your turn.

44
00:02:40,333 --> 00:02:41,792
I paint flowers.

45
