47
00:02:57,792 --> 00:03:00,250
What do you want to be when you grow up?

48
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:01,917
Say it again?

49
00:03:02,250 --> 00:03:03,792
Yoonsu, your turn.

50
00:03:04,167 --> 00:03:05,333
Say it again?

51
00:03:13,250 --> 00:03:15,750
Of course. What’s your dream, Yoonsu?

52
00:03:16,958 --> 00:03:18,792
I want to be an artist.

53
00:03:20,083 --> 00:03:21,292
