Maybe an artist.

57
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:33,042
Yoonsu, your turn.

58
00:03:33,417 --> 00:03:34,875
Maybe an artist.

59
00:03:41,792 --> 00:03:43,875
Why do you want to be an artist?

60
00:03:44,375 --> 00:03:45,833
I love colors.

61
00:03:46,167 --> 00:03:47,708
Yoonsu, your turn.

62
00:03:48,083 --> 00:03:49,542
I love colors.

63
00:03:56,833 --> 00:03:58,750
