64
00:03:59,667 --> 00:04:01,000
I have a dream.

65
00:04:02,125 --> 00:04:03,958
I want to be an artist.

66
00:04:04,917 --> 00:04:06,375
I like painting.

67
00:04:07,375 --> 00:04:09,125
