69
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:15,250
Thanks for listening.

70
00:04:15,583 --> 00:04:17,125
Yoonsu, your turn.

71
00:04:17,500 --> 00:04:19,000
Thanks for listening.

72
00:04:25,792 --> 00:04:27,875
You told us your dream!

73
00:04:29,667 --> 00:04:31,833
Thank you for sharing, Yoonsu.

74
00:04:32,375 --> 00:04:33,458
